	(2022696, 'Painful Truth', '', 'It\'s the absolute truth, but it really hurts. It might be better to not know the truth, for what you don\'t know can\'t hurt you. Provides WEAPON ATT +10 and MAGIC ATT +8 in your enraged state, but you suffer -50 MP for mental trauma.', 1, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
