	(4033898, 'Afrien\'s Record', '', 'Evan gave you this document from the onyx dragon, Afrien, containing a guide to the seal stones. The content is brief, and only people with a deep knowledge of magic can understand it. In short, a seal stone consists of three components. First, you need a medium for the continent that will act as the core of the seal stone. Second, you need five different powers. And third, a strong will to bring peace and prevent destruction must bring it all together.', 100, '1.0', 1, 0, 512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(4033899, 'Magical Score', '', 'Astilda gave you this magical score. Use it to add music to Elluel\'s Music Box.', 100, '1.0', 1, 0, 512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
