	(3994730, 'Paolo\'s Valentine\'s Coin', '', 'A coin minted to celebrate Valentine\'s Day. It doesn\'t have a lot of intrinsic value, but would definitely be valuable to many collectors.', 100, '0.0', 0, 0, 1552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994731, 'Lilin\'s Valentine\'s Coin', '', 'A coin minted to celebrate Valentine\'s Day. It doesn\'t have a lot of intrinsic value, but would definitely be valuable to many collectors.', 100, '0.0', 0, 0, 1552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994732, 'Jules\'s Valentine\'s Coin', '', 'A coin minted to celebrate Valentine\'s Day. It doesn\'t have a lot of intrinsic value, but would definitely be valuable to many collectors.', 100, '0.0', 0, 0, 1552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994722, 'Cassandra\'s Tiny Shoes', '', 'The pair of Cassandra’s shoes that were stolen by the Glowing Ghost. They still look new, and they are shockingly small... Like, circus-freak small.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1552, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994723, 'Fine Sifter', '', 'A sieve usually used to strain things. The sheer number of holes should keep the Glowing Ghost preoccupied for hours.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1040, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994724, 'Cassandra\'s New Shoes', '', 'A swanky new pair of kicks. #cThe Glowing Ghost will definitely take these away if you log out#!', 1, '1.0', 1, 0, 1072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994725, 'Nappy Shoes', '', 'A gently-used pair of shoes. #cYou might lose these if you log out#.', 1, '1.0', 1, 0, 1072, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994825, 'Shimmering Star', '', 'Take this shiny little piece of the sky to Cassandra to receive an awesome title decorated with stars.', 100, '1.0', 1, 0, 512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994741, 'Sea Horse', '', '[For Exhibition Only] If you had a thousand of these things, and a bunch of toy soldiers, you could play king of the sea!', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994742, 'Rainbow Fish', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Not really a rainbow, because it\'s missing blue AND purple. What a liar. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994743, 'Blowfish', '', '[For Exhibition Only] So adorable, so puffy, so fat, so extremely poisonous.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994744, 'Clown Fish', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Also called the \'least likely to succeed fish\'. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994745, 'Golden Fish', '', '[For Exhibition Only] It\'s not wrong to bite one of these to see if they\'re genuine. Just wait until the person who gave it to you is gone. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994746, 'Tuna Can', '', '[For Exhibition Only] A can of tuna. It\'s not really the museum\'s best piece.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994747, 'Poppin Fish', '', '[For Exhibition Only] It keeps doing that arm thing, only with fins.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994748, 'Breakin Fish', '', '[For Exhibition Only] It just keeps spinning on its head.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994749, 'Lockin Fish', '', '[For Exhibition Only] You are a fish, not a robot! Silly fish.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994750, 'Bamboo Spear', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Extremely dangerous and environmentally friendly.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994751, 'Frozen Tuna', '', '[For Exhibition Only] This totally isn\'t just some accidental leftover from that time the janitor kicked out the power at the Marine Museum.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994752, 'Radical Doubleshot', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Radicalawesomeman. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994753, 'Lovely Blade', '', '[For Exhibition Only] It\'s so absurdly adorable, you just want to cut something.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994754, 'Swanky Sword', '', '[For Exhibition Only] A famous swordsman once bought this from a guy for way too much and then had to pawn it.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994755, 'Golden Pot Lid', '', '[For Exhibition Only] A lid from the legendary golden ramen pot. A perfect weapon for grandmas.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994756, 'Toughguy Suit', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Can clothes be a weapon? No. That\'s ridiculous.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994757, 'Salamander Cestus', '', '[For Exhibition Only] The blacksmith who made this was terribly fond of amphibians. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994758, 'Heart Wand', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Moon prism-- wait, no, wrong one. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994759, 'Gingerbread Man', '', '[For Exhibition Only] A Gingerbread Man so realistic, you\'ll probably end up eating this before it makes it to the museum. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994760, 'Chocolate Heart', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Don\'t tell anybody, but there\'s an actual human heart inside that heart. Gross... yet tasty.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994761, 'Gingerbread Lady', '', '[For Exhibition Only] She just might come to life. Hopefully she\'s not super evil. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994762, 'Chocolate Cake', '', '[For Exhibition Only] This cake is a lie. It\'s actually all vanilla with food brown coloring. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994763, 'Han Gwa Set', '', '[For Exhibition Only] There\'s some legend about a crow or something, but mostly these are just cookies.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994764, 'Mochi Ice Cream', '', '[For Exhibition Only] If you fight through a layer of sugar goo, you\'ll get to the sweet ice cream center inside. ', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994765, 'Fruity Candy', '', '[For Exhibition Only] Preferred by old ladies \'round the world.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994766, 'Chiffon Cake', '', '[For Exhibition Only] The Empress Cygnus had this commissioned, but she fell asleep before it was ready.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994767, 'Cookie Ultimo', '', '[For Exhibition Only] A chef at a 5-star hotel made this cookie. Other cookies taste like garbage in comparison.', 100, '-1.0', -1, 0, 1024, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994801, 'Half-baked Gingerbread Cookie', '', 'This dough is actually one of the Gingerbread Man\'s friends. Leave him in your Set-up tab for 30 minutes to complete his baking. ', 1, '1.0', 1, 0, 1200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994802, 'Fully-baked Gingerbread Cookie', '', 'Take this to the Gingerbread Man. Do your best not to eat it on the way there... they\'re friends.', 100, '1.0', 1, 0, 1200, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
	(3994712, 'Snail Figurine', '', 'A snail statue for collectors. Drag into Cassandra\'s Collection.', 300, '0.0', 0, 0, 512, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 0, '', 0, '', 0, ''),
